<title>GERMANY: Chaboseau to join Allianz France - sources.</title>
<headline>Chaboseau to join Allianz France - sources.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jean-Claude Chaboseau, 45, will join Allianz France and become one of its top managers, a director general, German insurance sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Parent company Allianz AG Holding said it could not comment on the reports.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, Axa Colonia announced that Chaboseau is to leave the management of Colonia Versicherung AG and Nordstern Allgemeine Versicherungs-AG with effect from 30 June 1997.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Insurance News +49 221 512 007</p>
</text>
